The retained GHSA was the only initial substantive evidence. Its SOURCES.json declares the fixed coverage window ending **2026-10-04T08:13:00Z** and the extraction time. All new public-source receipts in this attempt were captured later on October 4. Historical SHAs and release tags identify the versions examined; these later acquisitions must not be represented as evidence captured within the frozen window. No later report, other lane, host memory, evaluator data or prior verdict was read.

