s findings, artifact paths, unresolved decisive questions and failures; it is not self-acceptance.\n\nOperating limits: 25 minutes for this original attempt; 8 GiB address space and node-1 affinity enforced by the runner. Save progress within the limit. Preserve this case's full chain in this context. The schema/checks support delivery and do not prove truth.\n\nYou are this case's sole adjudicator. Both original N=2 reports are now sealed, read-only, and available at their original paths:\nauditor1: /home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/incremental-causal-20261004-case-044/auditor1/workspace/output/alias-2a1ef1a8d7e0ad48955683d1\nauditor2: /home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/incremental-causal-20261004-case-044/auditor2/workspace/output/alias-2a1ef1a8d7e0ad48955683d1\nRead both full REPORT.md, record.json, research.json and decisive receipts. Inspect primary evidence and shared assumptions yourself. Continue decisive permitted research. Derive immutable output/decisions.json following DATA-SCHEMA.md, reducer incremental-causal-20261004-case-044-adjudicator, auditors [auditor1, auditor2], all input/accepted hashes, frozen contract/code/brief pins and required per-dimension resolutions/research work. Original manifest: /home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/incremental-causal-20261004-case-044/manifest.txt. Run the frozen reduction gate with each EXACT original record.json path as --lane auditor1=PATH / --lane auditor2=PATH, --accepted output/alias-2a1ef1a8d7e0ad48955683d1/record.json, --decisions output/decisions.json, --research-contract causal-work-v1. Preserve failures and the full original scope. Seal decisions separately outside their payload. Do not manufacture a substitute input, narrow N, or change findings for a passing check.\nAlready-retained primary Git objects, when present, are copied read-only in retained-git/{auditor}/NN.git with source-copy hash inventories. Inspect via git --git-dir=PATH or copy into owned output for ordinary Git operations. These are primary bytes, not an added judgment. No evaluator findings are supplied. Original evidence paths inside each sealed case directory resolve. Honor every original stop at its recorded scope; continue only unaffected permitted observations.\n\nAdditional bound material is in additional-primary/. Read operating clarifications as assignment constraints, not empirical evidence. Where primary captures are supplied, SOURCES.json records their identities and timestamps; preserve original retrieval failures and do not treat capture metadata as a judgment. Later observations do not change the source cutoff.\ncontract/AGENTS.md\ninputs/README.md\ninputs/SOURCES.json\ncontract/scripts/README.md\nretained-git/auditor1/SOURCES.json\nretained-git/auditor2/SOURCES.json\ncontract/docs/AUDIT-PROTOCOL.md\ncontract/docs/DATA-SCHEMA.md\ncontract/docs/ADJUDICATION-PROTOCOL.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
