y metadata and source/content comparison\", \"status\": \"ANSWERED\", \"observation\": \"Official release records resolve real tags and publication times. npm archive SHA512 matches registry; packaged fetch.js equals each Git tag; 1.19.0 Node bundle omits guard and 1.20.0 contains it on both paths. Git dist-member absence was recovered via npm archives.\", \"evidence\": [{\"path\": \"evidence/early-release.raw\", \"sha256\": \"3827098bf737fecd6a9ab9b0aa1ec5cadbde134e75303384ce52147762a3e3b2\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/declared-affected-tag.raw\", \"sha256\": \"b3cae1702b5086a72988d56fa9aa8a80ff46f9d2f75d411c41a0b4d3dcb971f9\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/release-118.raw\", \"sha256\": \"96720d695365bf137888d44735f1832ddc8e64cc172c17a5393a69ffa45b05cd\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/version-content.raw\", \"sha256\": \"4ccf40eafd7a4058d2f16052f337c77b71fdd9e53aa59fd83e31ec26c6c49b1a\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/release-1.7.0.raw\", \"sha256\": \"22ab0716bb2cefc1ffc9304fe0bda3b7413edf4f1b97b6846a5d3fc4780b9868\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/release-1.19.0.raw\", \"sha256\": \"0626802a2646ac59c9494b2a97f48a672398bc036f4910bc16e3c4f0dbca9e88\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/release-1.20.0.raw\", \"sha256\": \"1bd856370c3890c21517fd9e46801411f9c2e81965bdc947542532a35ff6e34f\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/package-content-check.raw\", \"sha256\": \"a33bfc4dacc7fd448ee101f249e85cb85818af8e7257c6b195d1643ee8555622\"}]}]}}, \"execution_failures\": [{\"operation\": \"initial ordinary Request-default check\", \"outcome\": \"FileNotFoundError before execution because node is absent; capture helper corrected to retain subprocess launch failures\", \"recovery\": [{\"path\": \"evidence/request-default-regression-unavailable.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"f9e24de7c9c44a454856ee4593790192a43f721475ec44c66a9db721a0144878\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/runtime-discovery.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"0bbbb1c5b817b378031a0922b20c0168396386a9c014b93926025afefe8a081e\"}], \"scope\": \"Optional execution corroboration unavailable; decisive static question answered independently.\"}, {\"operation\": \"test-path read\", \"outcome\": \"Exit 128 at obsolete singular test path; successful corrected read\", \"evidence\": [{\"path\": \"evidence/repair-tests.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"a692375174ecf7c959f4db9e06ed4f76ecf1411b258de84f4948dc7defb0a53e\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/repair-tests-corrected.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"bbc6545076e6563e86895b786a24855166305fe4cee9ade39766bc4e7e677922\"}]}, {\"operation\": \"Git bundled artifact reads\", \"outcome\": \"Exit 128 because tagged Git dist files absent; actual npm archives answered shipment\", \"evidence\": [{\"path\": \"evidence/bundled-fixed.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"c488c077501fa6b75c497f03be7281f7b3524cbecbc62b946edb8704511c7d82\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/bundled-affected.receipt.json\", \"sha256\": \"f83430768265394b914a919c6a9d5b3ea9eca6fedf3cb748a409d2eecf9f2afc\"}, {\"path\": \"evidence/package-content-check.raw\", \"sha256\": \"a33bfc4dacc7fd448ee101f249e85cb85818af8e7257c6b195d1643ee8555622\"}]}]}\nauditor2 {\"research\": {\"advisory\": {\"evidence_grade\": \"BOUND\", \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\", \"finding\": \"Keyed GHSA-r4gj-5m52-g5wh is ACTIVE (reviewed, published 2026-09-30, withdrawn_at null); alias CVE-2026-101907 is ACTIVE (published 2026-09-28, Awaiting Analysis, no rejection). No dead alias; no false-positive ground.\", \"evidence\": [{\"path\": \"evidence/receipt_advisory.txt\", \"sha256\": \"0256be4c43008e10f08f6b641e049219d28385d2d10cbee86c1929f1d0ac7942\"}], \"missing_fact\": null, \"next_permitted_route\": null, \"routes\": []}, \"mechanism\": {\"evidence_grade\": \"BOUND\", \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\", \"finding\": \"In lib/adapters/fetch.js the fetch adapter destructures resolveConfig(config) without reading maxRedirects and builds the fetch options object without a redirect key, so the Fetch API default redirect:'follow' applies and a caller's maxRedirects:0 guard is bypassed. Requires an attacker-influenced redi