chable through `serialize()`, `normalize()`, and `equal()` in their object forms. A `port` obtained from `parse()` is always digits and is not affected.\\n\\n### Patches\\n\\nThis vulnerability has been patched in fast-uri `4.1.4`, `3.1.7`, and `2.4.6`. `recomposeAuthority` now rejects any port that is not `*DIGIT` per RFC 3986. All users should upgrade.\\n\\n### Workarounds\\n\\nIf upgrading is not immediately possible, validate the `port` value against the RFC 3986 grammar (digits only) before passing a component to `serialize()`, `normalize()`, or `equal()`, and reject anything else, for example `if (!/^\\\\d*$/.test(String(port))) throw new Error('invalid port')`.\",\n  \"vulnerabilities\": [\n    {\n      \"package\": {\n        \"ecosystem\": \"npm\",\n        \"name\": \"fast-uri\"\n      },\n      \"vulnerable_version_range\": \"< 2.4.6\",\n      \"first_patched_version\": \"2.4.6\",\n      \"vulnerable_functions\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"package\": {\n        \"ecosystem\": \"npm\",\n        \"name\": \"fast-uri\"\n      },\n      \"vulnerable_version_range\": \">= 3.0.0, < 3.1.7\",\n      \"first_patched_version\": \"3.1.7\",\n      \"vulnerable_functions\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"package\": {\n        \"ecosystem\": \"npm\",\n        \"name\": \"fast-uri\"\n      },\n      \"vulnerable_version_range\": \">= 4.0.0, < 4.1.4\",\n      \"first_patched_version\": \"4.1.4\",\n      \"vulnerable_functions\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"cveId\": \"CVE-2026-84292\",\n  \"assignerOrgId\": \"ce714d77-add3-4f53-aff5-83d477b104bb\",\n  \"state\": \"PUBLISHED\",\n  \"assignerShortName\": \"openjs\",\n  \"dateReserved\": \"2026-09-01T16:10:49.688Z\",\n  \"datePublished\": \"2026-09-02T20:09:51.415Z\",\n  \"dateUpdated\": \"2026-09-03T13:16:25.237Z\"\n}\n{\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/pull/201\",\n  \"body\": \"## Summary\\n\\n- percent-encode structural delimiters in serialized userinfo, query, and fragment data\\n- preserve each component's RFC 3986 literal character set and valid escapes\\n- encode Unicode as UTF-8 without changing parsed URI round trips\\n- verify reparsing cannot move userinfo data into the host\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- focused regression: 16/16 passed\\n- `npm test`: 1137/1137 passed\\n- `npm run lint`: passed\\n- `npm run test:typescript`: 7/7 assertions passed\\n- `git diff --check`: passed\\n\",\n  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"62a776eda1777ec6cfbe62d3888cd61a52b723ff\",\n  \"commits\": 1\n}\nresearch coverage loaded and sealed: [{'retained_git_inventories': 'all supplied file hashes verified', 'stores': 2}, {'captured_at': '2026-10-04T18:20:03.149061+00:00', 'source_window_end': '2026-10-04T08:13:00Z'}]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
