ha256\": \"2a422cf08b6ecae4e3152d50013d944ca1d655d349bf8072c2af2c1bde3afe40\",\n    \"original_page_path\": \"/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/.ai-slop/state/incremental-20261004T081300Z/capture/nvd-modified-0003.body\",\n    \"original_pointer\": \"/vulnerabilities/606/cve\",\n    \"source_window_end\": \"2026-10-04T08:13:00Z\",\n    \"extraction_at\": \"2026-10-04T08:38:03.035774+00:00\",\n    \"operation\": \"Exact primary object extraction; no added case judgment.\"\n  }\n]\n\n=== brief ===\nApply the frozen radar-audit skill at /home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/incremental-causal-20261004-case-051/auditor2/workspace/contract/.agents/skills/radar-audit/SKILL.md. You are incremental-causal-20261004-case-051-auditor2, independent attempt 1 for alias-36e8c2c4d5de7daa278db2cb; leader/handoff recipient incremental-causal-20261004T081300Z-lead; endpoint research handoff only. Read frozen contract/docs/AUDIT-PROTOCOL.md, DATA-SCHEMA.md, contract/scripts/README.md Submission. Adopt protocol 2026-09-27.3 and causal-work-v1; gate dependencies are colocated in contract/scripts/. Neutral question and retained sources: inputs/README.md and SOURCES.json.\n\nIndependently investigate the whole causal chain, using retained primary material and normal public first-party research as needed. Choose the decisive observations yourself. Do not end available research merely by describing its gap. Preserve failures and respect actual source denials and safety stops. Defensive source/version/history inspection and isolated ordinary regression checks are permitted; do not execute exploits, create operational payloads or contact deployed targets. Do not read prior audit/site judgments, host memories, evaluator material or another lane. Shared Git reads require GIT_NO_LAZY_FETCH=1 and GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS=0. The source coverage cutoff is 2026-10-04T08:13:00Z; distinguish later decisive evidence from that fixed coverage window. No database, claims, deployment or canonical writes.\n\nWrite output/alias-36e8c2c4d5de7daa278db2cb/REPORT.md before deriving record.json. Save complete source-bound findings, receipts and a research.json sidecar covering all six contract dimensions there. Use class_id alias-36e8c2c4d5de7daa278db2cb. Run frozen strict record checks, including relevant local-object checks if objects are available; retain commands, exits and failures, and explicitly qualify checks that could not run. Read back for agreement. Seal stable case files with exact hashes in SEAL.json, excluding the seal itself. Keep runtime-home and runner-final outside sealed case payloads. Your final response names findings, artifact paths, unresolved decisive questions and failures; it is not self-acceptance.\n\nOperating limits: 25 minutes for this original attempt; 8 GiB address space and node-1 affinity enforced by the runner. Save progress within the limit. Preserve this case's full chain in this context. The schema/checks support delivery and do not prove truth.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
