or coverage, but still omits quote. Its 1.12.0 tree preserves this case's defect. No AI marker was found that would support reclassifying this incomplete remediation as an AI-attributed causal contribution.\n\nDecisive receipts: `root.out`, `connect-history.out`, `connect-origin.out`, `connect-earlier.out`, `connect-root.out`, `origin-boundary.out`, `causal-diffs.out`, `verify-sources.out`. The owned authoritative Connect clone is non-shallow and passes fsck. The bounded upstream-history probe reached its parentless 2010 aggregate; exact-blob history returned that root and subsequent moves/changes, not a preceding logger member. There is no identified PR for the root to fetch. This is the terminus of that bounded recovery route, not proof that no earlier private or external source ever existed. `introducer_sha` and `bic_granularity` remain null rather than assigning an atomic role to the bundle. The report retains both package import and earlier aggregate separately.\n\n## Repair and shipment\n\n`4b695edf967ce179cdf4009fe8cddd184b7511ee` adds double quote to the helper's character class and a switch arm emitting backslash-quote. Backslashes are already escaped by the same replacement, so source backslashes cannot supply an unescaped escape prefix under the intended escape-aware field grammar. Token registration already wraps all built-in string values at this parent. Therefore the change reaches URL, user-agent, referrer, remote-user and generic string-valued req/res tokens before interpolation. Format functions that invoke these tokens benefit too. The developer's arbitrary function that writes raw request data directly, or returns custom objects, is outside this token-escaping guarantee. There is no observed omitted built-in string-token sibling for the quoted-field mechanism.\n\nThe first-parent default-branch sequence is parent `0f74eca...` → repair `4b695edf...` → release `b1272e70812dbc504321eeb5a43d14b0822c150d`. This is a direct mechanism-closing commit on master, not a repair reachable only through a later side-branch merge. Its source hunk and associated tests serve one logical quoting correction: fix granularity ATOMIC. No alternative repair landing is claimed.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
