78916534bfa33f14644fec6e59f024\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"missing_fact\": null,\n    \"next_permitted_route\": null,\n    \"routes\": []\n  },\n  \"bic\": {\n    \"evidence_grade\": \"QUALIFIED_BOUNDARY\",\n    \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\",\n    \"finding\": \"Vulnerable behavior exists at the 2010 Connect aggregate boundary; the 2014 Morgan import is byte-identical to older Connect source. Both 2026 hardening transitions preserve the quote omission. Atomic original member is unresolved.\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/origin-boundary.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"1cf75c50e942c3d9208a771b92084700820a088de5943ab388ba620d10ad8305\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/connect-root.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"46cbf016d00f4c87fc110a664fae7971cd7099ab1f0aea26fcbd2019cf820752\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/causal-diffs.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"c7785ab29d22b6bb9927d37b3525dcfaca1301f0c057f9bc1f3ce82b4c3d2806\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/verify-sources.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"0f0363d60d43389a8ce85e2e602bdc07d30112c1dab52e7fc8c3d7a9e4a1db86\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"missing_fact\": \"The original atomic logger contribution and its immediate parent/provenance before Connect root b29880dc05eaa8fd72aff20e741dde5cdf98ccc6 are unrecovered. The 2010 root bundles unrelated subsystems; the 2014 Morgan import is byte-identical to older Connect source. Named carrier identities and locally absent AI markers do not settle contribution-level attribution.\",\n    \"next_permitted_route\": null,\n    \"routes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"upstream-original-member\",\n        \"question\": \"What atomic original logger contribution predates the observed root?\",\n        \"source\": \"https://github.com/senchalabs/connect.git\",\n        \"evidence_type\": \"Retained primary history and metadata comparison\",\n        \"status\": \"EXHAUSTED\",\n        \"observation\": \"Non-shallow authoritative history, path moves and exact-blob inquiry end at parentless multi-subsystem root b29880dc05eaa8fd72aff20e741dde5cdf98ccc6. No earlier member or PR identified; this is the bounded history frontier, not proof of global absence.\",\n        \"evidence\": [\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/connect-clone.receipt.json\",\n            \"sha256\": \"7e0abeeda8d11336297ae687203e74bef20fe653fce921ae8b0641ae50b7595c\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/connect-history.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"a4a032fffe2740343f758ff363d2f6b65a826a019e5ae4647ce3599c1d5edfbf\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/origin-boundary.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"1cf75c50e942c3d9208a771b92084700820a088de5943ab388ba620d10ad8305\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"ai\": {\n    \"evidence_grade\": \"QUALIFIED_BOUNDARY\",\n    \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\",\n    \"finding\": \"All 428 local Morgan commit carriers were enumerated with metadata and path/blob identity; no accepted AI marker was found. Named human carriers and non-AI coauthor trailers do not establish unrecovered original member provenance. Neither incomplete hardening nor successful repair supplies an admissible AI attribution.\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/all-carriers-v2.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"ea83a79b81ea611c6f21e25e3f1c599a427ba2b1ea759e09d0f3be13813e692a\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/convention.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"107a9a2ec0857432c5b5c6558884c2700482474c383b1b6c663c6bf8cf97ba4c\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-comments.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"2ee78bd21b81f7fbbe4c1d9002ba7a75f348089ea537d53f478139b42ca1fada\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-pulls.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"31ea47c6b55fbe5300d603cc6450f5a729b54a8c5521aebf5eecfb202beed5ce\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"missing_fact\": \"Contribution-specific provenance of the original logger member, or a content-bound AI disclosure for an incomplete hardening contribution, remains unknown.\",\n    \"next_permitted_route\": null,\n    \"routes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"contribution-provenance\",\n        \"question\": \"Does available first-party provenance attribute the causal logger or incomplete hardening to AI?\",\n        \"source\": \"expressjs/morgan Git objects, contemporary metadata, security advisory and public commit comments/PR association\",\n        \"evidence_type\": \"Retained primary history and metadata comparison\",\n        \"status\": \"EXHAUSTED\",\n        \"observation\": \"Full fetched local carrier universe and bounded first-party sources yield no admissible AI disclosure. Original pre-root member is unrecovered; absence is limited to inspected sources and cannot prove NOT_AI.\",\n        \"evidence\": [\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/all-carriers-v2.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"ea83a79b81ea611c6f21e25e3f1c599a427ba2b1ea759e09d0f3be13813e692a\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-advisory.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"56ab3e486cdb031a37b29b683e29fd6a1f9db4307591f03ecf0abef22f56b589\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-page.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"9218599860f3488ed550ceec36dd899ae00e429e91af69556d5fbe117c797a3c\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-comments.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"2ee78bd21b81f7fbbe4c1d9002ba7a75f348089ea537d53f478139b42ca1fada\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"path\": \"receipts/first-hardening-pulls.out\",\n            \"sha256\": \"31ea47c6b55fbe5300d603cc6450f5a729b54a8c5521aebf5eecfb202beed5ce\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"fix\": {\n    \"evidence_grade\": \"BOUND\",\n    \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\",\n    \"finding\": \"Quote added to escapeLogField character class and switch; existing token wrapper applies it before interpolation for all registered string tokens. Direct default-branch closure, then release commit b1272e70812dbc504321eeb5a43d14b0822c150d. Arbitrary developer formatting that bypasses tokens is outside this closure claim.\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/causal-diffs.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"c7785ab29d22b6bb9927d37b3525dcfaca1301f0c057f9bc1f3ce82b4c3d2806\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/release-source.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"c4cbd7eab8141c501a9dc08c971f5852ce2f3c71418141aa07024fc6d7ad9a9a\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/verify-sources.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"0f0363d60d43389a8ce85e2e602bdc07d30112c1dab52e7fc8c3d7a9e4a1db86\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"missing_fact\": null,\n    \"next_permitted_route\": null,\n    \"routes\": []\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"evidence_grade\": \"BOUND\",\n    \"work_state\": \"COMPLETE\",\n    \"finding\": \"Official stable 1.12.1 release resolves to b1272e70812dbc504321eeb5a43d14b0822c150d; npm tarball integrity passes and index.js equals repair and tag. Selected earlier releases retain the omission; not every historical package artifact was downloaded. Captured after cutoff.\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/release-metadata.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"c318a9a5a795e4738b14c51f874191080827dfcc01d9e9b16f1ebbc9b3f79b9a\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/npm-version.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"21a992596f9e59c29b1c1e57ed62d7051278f6f1d6aba66be4ad21be92b0d79b\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/release-identity.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"8a016591ca03d7dd5269120eaba68665d8b410a0b76d05882fa47a2d35b31b68\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"receipts/verify-sources.out\",\n        \"sha256\": \"0f0363d60d43389a8ce85e2e602bdc07d30112c1dab52e7fc8c3d7a9e4a1db86\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"missing_fact\": null,\n    \"next_permitted_route\": null,\n    \"routes\": []\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
